OL,3,GNEWSATop Scottish KC cleared of
OL,4,Aprofessional misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top lawyer has been cleared of
OL,7,Fprofessional misconduct over complaints
OL,8,Fhe acted improperly during a legal feud
OL,9,Fover a dating app.
OL,11,FAndrew Smith KC was censured by the
OL,12,FFaculty of Advocates complaints
OL,13,Fcommittee in 2024.
OL,15,FHe failed in his first bid to overturn
OL,16,Fthe decision, but the case was
OL,17,Fconsidered again by the faculty's
OL,18,Fdisciplinary tribunal following a
OL,19,Fruling by a judge at the Court of
OL,20,FSession earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
